Subject: [PATCH] refactor(mm): link original mapping writeback waits

---
 mm/filemap.c       | 120 --------------------------------------------
 mm/filemap_batch.c | 121 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 mm/filemap_batch.h |   3 ++
 3 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 120 deletions(-)

